  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - Even as your body feels heavy, the Draugr Overlord refuses to let up!
  - The Draugr Overlord sweeps directly at your legs.
  - 'The Draugr Overlord begins chanting something, and you swear you could hear
    him say: "Double Dutch." (???)'
